#! program build/docs-examples/bin/tut11_run
#! args    --examples /tmp/figure-studio --case /tmp/figure-studio/plate
#! frames  330
#! poster  300
# Run: the solver's lines fill the log, the residual plot grows on a logarithmic axis, the status bar shows the
# iteration and the progress towards the tolerance; at the end a notification says the solver converged
# (the solver runs in real time while the frames are drawn at the capture's pace: the video's timing depends on the
# machine, the poster is the end of the run)
0   move 600 300
10  move 384 384 15
30  down
32  up
50  move 700 250 30
